From: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: phy: realtek: harden MDIO/PHY helper error handling

Propagate MDIO read/write errors and guard initialization paths in realtek_main.
Signed-off-by: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 drivers/net/phy/realtek/realtek_main.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/net/phy/realtek/realtek_main.c b/drivers/net/phy/realtek/realtek_main.c
index 96e34af..a20bb39 100644
--- a/drivers/net/phy/realtek/realtek_main.c
+++ b/drivers/net/phy/realtek/realtek_main.c
@@ -995,7 +995,7 @@ static int rtlgen_write_mmd(struct phy_device *phydev, int devnum, u16 regnum,
 	if (devnum == MDIO_MMD_VEND2)
 		ret = rtlgen_write_vend2(phydev, regnum, val);
 	else if (devnum == MDIO_MMD_AN && regnum == MDIO_AN_EEE_ADV)
-		ret = rtlgen_write_vend2(phydev, regnum, RTL_MDIO_AN_EEE_ADV);
+		ret = rtlgen_write_vend2(phydev, RTL_MDIO_AN_EEE_ADV, val);
 	else
 		ret = -EOPNOTSUPP;
 
